{"id":"wb-5-245","name":"觉山寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"觉山寺","text":"觉山寺，又称普照寺，创建于北魏太和七年（483年），是北魏皇家寺院，位于山西省大同市灵丘县东南14千米笔架山西侧。觉山寺塔于2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A7%89%E5%B1%B1%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":92026938,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92026938","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5ac92480b33af4c8fb68e1b6.jpg","title":"觉山寺塔-1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%A7%89%E5%B1%B1%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94-1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/29/%E8%A7%89%E5%B1%B1%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Fymking","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"该照片的内容为中国全国重点文物保护单位。编号： 5-245","width":320,"height":213}}